      <p>Family Assistance Legislation Amendment (Extend Family Assistance to ABSTUDY Secondary School Boarding Students Aged 16 and Over) Act 2019</p>
      <p>No. 73, 2019</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to family assistance, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to </i><i>20</i><i> September 2019</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
